From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Massimo <github@maksimtech.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Keep the ADSys fixes to certificate auto-enrollment

Carry the fixes applied directly to the vendored extension in 2025, so
that the automated Samba update stops reverting them:

- Query the enrollment services and certificate templates under the
  configuration naming context, and resolve the default naming context
  for the LDAP end point lookup, which fixes multi-domain forests.
- Fetch the root certificates over https, as the documentation requires.
- Skip the files and templates bookkeeping once the data map has been
  replaced by an error report.
- Log the discovered templates and CAs, and keep enrolling to the
  remaining CAs when one of them fails.

Original fixes by Denison Barbosa <denison.barbosa@canonical.com>.
---
 python/samba/gp/gp_cert_auto_enroll_ext.py | 56 +++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 39 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

diff --git a/python/samba/gp/gp_cert_auto_enroll_ext.py b/python/samba/gp/gp_cert_auto_enroll_ext.py
--- a/python/samba/gp/gp_cert_auto_enroll_ext.py
